flowchart LR
    U[Users] -->|HTTPS| W[Azure App Service<br/>Linux · 2+ workers]
    W -->|/health every minute| HC[App Service Health Check]
    HC -->|Unhealthy worker<br/>remove from routing| W
    W -->|Repeated HTTP 5xx| AH[App Service Auto-Heal]
    AH -->|Recycle app process| W
    W -->|Traces and logs| AI[Application Insights]
    AI --> LAW[Log Analytics workspace]
    W -->|Http5xx metric| AM[Azure Monitor metric alert]
    AM --> AG[Action Group<br/>optional email]
    GH[GitHub Actions] -->|OIDC short-lived identity| ENTRA[Microsoft Entra ID]
    ENTRA -->|Scoped RBAC| W
    TF[Terraform] -->|Provisions| W
    TF -->|Remote state in Azure Blob| STATE[Private Storage Container]
